   <transaction-date iso-date="2021-12-06"></transaction-date>
   <value currency="GBP" value-date="2021-12-06">100000</value>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Movement contribution to the IFRC for Cash and Voucher Assistance (CVA) work in the Africa Region for 2021.
The grant will include the following earmarked allocations for a &#xa3;150,000 grant to the IFRC: &#xa3;100,000 for RedRose pilots (&#xa3;50,000 for Tanzania, &#xa3;25,000 for Zambia RC and &#xa3;25,000 for Gambia RC). &#xa3;50,000 to support developing Communities of Practice in Africa, which includes &#xa3;9,000 GBP (CVA Officer Cameroon for 3 months of salary support from Oct-Dec 2021) and &#xa3;41,000 GBP (CVAP meetings in East and Central Africa).
Grant coding:
&#xa3;100,000 to come from the Cash Team Budget, 54570/ G
&#xa3;50,000 to come from the East Africa Team Budget, 54531/ G/ P5550</narrative>
   </description>
